  "reviewed_invariants": [
    "Private NodeResultCache belongs to worker and is published only after successful await, absolute deadline check and current-owner check; cancellation is not swallowed by degraded-errors handling.",
    "One absolute optional deadline reaches seed trace/ref loops, load_entry, real _read_entry and immediately before index admission. Expired worker stops additional cache get_bytes operations after already-entered backend returns.",
    "ReadBudget checked before recovery I/O; exhausted gate bypasses optional cache and native node read gate reports correct read budget refusal with zero recovery reads and zero additional producer calls after the completed cold setup.",
    "Workflow body wait_for receives residual absolute time after startup; expired startup raises before seed reads and producer.",
    "Existing helper ContextVar copy propagates active tenant/access context; positive same-run warm replay calls producer once and preserves assignment/null/deletion/current unrelated state; actual permission/digest/foreignscope refuses.",
    "Unconfigured workflow retains None deadline; existing helper bounded wait timeout uses empty owned cache bypass rather than importing a configured workflow deadline, and late private worker cannot mutate exposed cache.",
    "Superseded _seed_cache owner check prevents replacing newer owner cache; this verifies seed inlet ownership and does not claim fully reentrant concurrent execute support."
